# The Err half of src/tychoc.c:6086: E_OK always resolves to a PARTIAL Result,
# so nesting one inside Err leaves the error type unfixed. Written beside the Ok
# fixture because the two spellings are separate arms.
# expect: Err(...) needs a concrete value
fn main():
    x := Err(Ok())
    println(str(len(str(x))))
